  "name": "medium-core-off-baseline",
  "lab": "Medium lab",
  "title": "Baseline \u00b7 STP off on the MLAG pair, RSTP on the access switch (campus option 1)",
  "action": "Resets the data bridge on all three CHRs over management SSH: protocol-mode=none and forward-reserved-addresses=no on both MLAG peers, protocol-mode=rstp priority=0x0000 on the access switch, with edge=yes on its uplink bond and edge=yes, bpdu-guard=yes and loop-protect=on on its host port ether4, and reads the access switch port settings back. Then run numbered 100 ms pings for 4 s in both VLAN 110 and both bypass directions, read back bridge, MLAG, RSTP and LACP state, and send three ARP broadcasts each way. No fault is applied.",
